  "summary": "Visual algorithmic language from the Soviet/Russian space programme (Buran) whose strict flowchart rules (\"silhouette\", \"primitive\") make diagrams readable; DRAKON editors generate code in host languages such as C, Lua, JavaScript and Erlang.",
